monster_from:
ZzzCharacter.cpp:14107-14112, CreateMonster, case MONSTER_LARVA:

    OpenMonsterModel(MONSTER_MODEL_LARVA);
    c = CreateCharacter(Key, MODEL_LARVA, PositionX, PositionY);
    wcscpy(c->ID, L"유충");
    c->Object.Scale = 0.6f;

No weapon, no BlendMesh, no HiddenMesh, no Level. MODEL_LARVA's only other line is the bounding box (ZzzCharacter.cpp:11807).

effects_from:
ZzzCharacter.cpp:6148-6168, MoveCharacterVisual: MODEL_LARVA shares its case with MODEL_DARK_KNIGHT and MODEL_CHAIN_SCORPION --

    if (c->Dead == 0 && rand_fps_check(4))
        ... CreateParticle(BITMAP_SMOKE + 1, Position, o->Angle, Light);

with Position scattered 32 units about its feet (BITMAP_SMOKE in Devias alone). That is the Chain Scorpion's ground_dust exactly, declared the same way; the scorpion's sting light is behind `if (o->Type == MODEL_CHAIN_SCORPION)` and is not the Larva's.

Its poison is the realm's, not the figure's: OpenMU's AttackSkill 1 on a bite (AttackRange 1), no missile.
